title A push in the middle
intro Blue has the ball near the halfway line.
flip vertical

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player B-CM at 50, 30
  player R-CM at 62, 30
  ball with B-CM

step
  caption Blue is dribbling up the middle.

step
  caption Red runs in and shoves Blue over.
  R-CM to 53, 30
  label R-CM Push
  arrow from R-CM to B-CM
  banner Foul
  duration 1100

question
  prompt Is that allowed?
  answer No
  wrong Yes
  wrong Only in the middle
  wrong Only if you get the ball
  correct That is a foul.
  why You cannot push someone over to get the ball. Go for the ball, not the player.

question
  prompt What does Blue get?
  answer A free kick
  wrong A penalty kick
  wrong A throw-in
  wrong A corner
  correct A free kick.
  why The foul happened out in the middle, so Blue restarts with a free kick right there.
